# A note with live shell blocks: a chart that keeps moving, and one block
# reading another's result.
size 1280 800
hide
keys :
type open notes.md
keys enter
wait-for Machine
show
wait 1
keys / 
type every=1
keys enter
keys space m r
wait 0.5
keys a
wait 5
keys / 
type input=pods
keys enter
keys space m r
wait 1
keys ctrl-d
wait 2
shot notes
wait 2
